<title>USA: Brazil to issue 5-10 yr Yankee notes soon--Loyola.</title>
<headline>Brazil to issue 5-10 yr Yankee notes soon--Loyola.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's Central Bank President Gustavo Loyola said on Sunday that the Brazilian government intended to issue approximately $750 million of five- or 10-year Yankee notes.</p>
<p>In a release, Loyola said the issue will take place &quot;in the near future&quot; and the proceeds will be used to retire domestic Brazilian debt.</p>
</text>
